A.text:
Use `DATATABLE`:

```dax
EVALUATE
DATATABLE(
    "ProductID", INTEGER,
    "Name", STRING,
    {
        {1, "Apple"},
        {2, "Banana"}
    }
)
```

B.text:
Use **DATATABLE**. Example:

```dax
EVALUATE
DATATABLE(
    "Product", STRING,
    "Price", CURRENCY,
    "Quantity", INTEGER,
    {
        { "A", 10, 1 },
        { "B", 20, 2 }
    }
)
```
